# Ads Analytics Engine — environment (copy to .env)
#
# Data acquisition is the official Meta Ads MCP ONLY, configured INSIDE Claude
# (custom connector, OAuth). There are NO Meta credentials here — and there must
# NOT be: calling the Graph API with a raw token (or via a third-party broker) can
# get the ad account BANNED. If the official MCP isn't enabled for your account
# yet, the engine can't fetch data — by design. See mcp/README.md.

ADS_ENGINE_DB=ads_engine.db     # SQLite path for the daily store
